\subsection{Channel-by-Channel Analysis}

\paragraph{Di-lepton channel.}
Provides the cleanest signal with minimal background.

\paragraph{Di-photon channel.}
Sensitive to enhanced gauge couplings.

\paragraph{Di-jet channel.}
Largest cross section but poorest resolution.

